@startuml
title PIPE — Transition Candidate Stage

skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam QueueBorderColor #A855F7
skinparam QueueBackgroundColor #FAF5FF

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Recruiter" as Recruiter
boundary "Job Kanban UI" as UI
control "Spring Security" as Security
control "TenantWebInterceptor" as Interceptor
boundary "WorkflowController" as Controller
control "WorkflowService" as Service
database "Tenant DB (MySQL)" as TenantDB
queue "RabbitMQ notify-email" as RabbitMQ

note over Recruiter, Security
  Preconditions: tenant ACTIVE; caller can manage the job;
  card is not in a locked terminal hiring state.
end note

== Load Kanban ==

Recruiter -> UI: Open job pipeline
activate UI
UI -> Security: GET /api/v1/jobs/{jobId}/pipeline
activate Security
Security -> Interceptor: Forward after RBAC
activate Interceptor
deactivate Security
Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getPipeline(jobId)
activate Service
Service -> TenantDB: Load stages and applications
activate TenantDB
TenantDB --> Service: Columns and cards
deactivate TenantDB
Service --> Controller: PipelineBoardResponse
deactivate Service
Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller
UI --> Recruiter: Render Kanban columns
Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
deactivate Interceptor

== Move card ==

Recruiter -> UI: Drag card to another stage
UI -> Security: POST /api/v1/applications/{id}/move
activate Security

alt Unauthenticated or forbidden
  Security --> UI: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
  deactivate Security
  UI --> Recruiter: Show access error
else Authorized
  Security -> Interceptor: Forward authenticated request
  activate Interceptor
  deactivate Security
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
  Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: move(actorId, id, request)
  activate Service
  Service -> TenantDB: Load Application, from-stage, to-stage, last history
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Current card and stages
  deactivate TenantDB

  alt Missing card/stage, stale version, or illegal transition
    Service --> Controller: 404 / 409 / 422
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: Error status
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Reload board or show blocked move
  else Transition allowed
    Service -> TenantDB: Close previous history (exitedAt, durationSeconds)
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Prior stay closed
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service -> TenantDB: UPDATE application.stage_id, status, updated_at
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Card saved
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service -> TenantDB: INSERT history (toStage, enteredAt, actor, note)
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Audit row
    deactivate TenantDB

    opt Target is Assessment or Interview
      Service -> RabbitMQ: publishStageChanged(tenantId, applicationId, toCode)
      activate RabbitMQ
      RabbitMQ --> Service: Accepted
      deactivate RabbitMQ
    end

    Service --> Controller: ApplicationCardResponse
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: 200 OK
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Card sits in the new column
  end
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
  deactivate Interceptor
end

deactivate UI

note over TenantDB, RabbitMQ
  Time in stage = exitedAt - enteredAt of the closed history row.
  Assessment/Interview workers are not executed here; only a tenant-scoped event is published.
end note

@enduml
